DeployIdentityCheckInputsTest
├── when both safes are nonzero
│   └── it should pass
├── when both methods share one safe
│   └── it should pass
├── when the zkPassport method safe is zero
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should raise the zero safe error naming ZKPASSPORT_METHOD_SAFE
├── when the Aadhaar method safe is zero on a chain that ships Aadhaar
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should raise the zero safe error naming AADHAAR_METHOD_SAFE
├── when both safes are zero
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should raise the zero safe error naming ZKPASSPORT_METHOD_SAFE
├── when the chain ships no Aadhaar and its safe is zero
│   └── it should pass
├── when the chain ships no Aadhaar and its safe is nonzero
│   └── it should pass
└── when the chain ships no Aadhaar and the zkPassport method safe is zero
    ├── it should revert
    └── it should raise the zero safe error naming ZKPASSPORT_METHOD_SAFE
